  "body": "## sqly v1.7.1\n\nRun SQL over CSV, TSV, LTSV, JSON, JSONL, Parquet, Excel, ACH, Fedwire, and\nsupported compressed inputs (.gz, .bz2, .xz, .zst, .z, .snappy, .s2, .lz4).\n\nInstall or upgrade, then see the grouped highlights below. Every artifact is\nsigned and ships with an SBOM and build provenance — see\n[Verifying release integrity](https://github.com/nao1215/sqly#verifying-release-integrity).\n\n## Changelog\n### Performance\n* d04e6ce9a39aa7052e2480d3ebee9e17fac65dab: perf: measure sqly end to end with himorime (#975) (@nao1215)\n### Documentation\n* 60a2097c0dafefccc8ae49b926a08b6da6475c30: docs: add himorime measurement badge (#976) (@nao1215)\n### Others\n* 0c302e66f928db1039149fa4b4da65e731252737: build(deps): raise the Go floor to 1.26.6 for the golang.org/x updates (#980) (@nao1215)\n* 9f6dd0f354b91b28ba09a0fab2ea31ad3d1f92a0: build(deps): update filesql to v0.59.0 and prompt to v0.3.0 (#982) (@nao1215)\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/nao1215/sqly/compare/v1.7.0...v1.7.1\n\n",
